 <p id="source-p1217"><strong>[3] Chief of Naval Air Training, CNATRA P-1217, Operational Navigation Flight Training Instruction, Two-Plane Road Reconnaissance, (7-99) Original.</strong> Read on the same mirror, 27 October 2026: <a href="https://navyflightmanuals.tpub.com/P-1217/The-Pop-Up-Attack-46.htm">the pop-up attack (p. 33)</a>; <a href="https://navyflightmanuals.tpub.com/P-1217/The-Roll-In-47.htm">the roll-in (p. 34)</a>. Also cited: pp. 35, 36 and 38.</p>
