 <p class="note">Applicability: written for military pilots of every service who fly fixed-wing attack. The principles are the same in any aircraft, but every number here is a T-45 training number with practice bombs from Navy training publications [1–3] of 1999–2003; your aircraft's tactical manual, its delivery tables and your unit's rules govern. Air Force weapons-delivery instructions could not be read for this revision, so no Air Force-specific rules are included. This revision is Drafted pending independent source-backed review.</p>
